worm-logs-v001 changes
- Created /opt/worm/services/logs Python WSGI app with SQLite metadata DB.
- Created /opt/worm/services/logs/.venv and installed gunicorn 26.2.0.
- Imported existing /opt/worm/logs/*.log metadata into SQLite.
- Legacy logs outside runs are exposed through hardlinks under /opt/worm/logs/runs/legacy, without moving originals or duplicating file data.
- Added /usr/local/bin/worm-run global command.
- Added wormlogs system user and worm-logs.service bound to 127.0.0.1:8765.
- Updated nginx VPN config with logs.coffee.pm reverse proxy to 127.0.0.1:8765.
- Updated nginx public guard config to include logs.coffee.pm with existing 403 policy.
- Backed up nginx configs as *.bak-worm-logs-v001-* before modification.
- Added rollback.sh.
